To see what’s going on with someone else as well! Here are some ways that will help improve visibility:

-Tap “Add Friends” from within any section of Snaps (profile or chat) then choose which type – whether it be through adding people you know exclusively via phone numbers/emails. Or by searching for others who share similar interests;
-When viewing another user’s story, look near the top left corner where there should also exist an option called “View all stories.” This allows one full scroll through everything that has been posted thus far. As well as any future updates they may make public
